## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop:** state obj `G`; `rnd(G)` mulberry32 seeded from `G.rngState`; `endTurnPhaseA/B` run storm→production→needs→arrivals→event→trade→finish in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 Map:** 64-tile grid (8x8 CSS+JS); `genMap` uses `rnd(G)` seeded from seed; `build()` checks `d.ter.includes(t.ter)`; `adjCount` bonuses feed directly into `prodOne` output math. Score 2.

**F3 Economy:** chains ore→metal (forge), ash+water→soil (composter), soil+water→food (greenhouse); `capOf`/`addRes` clamp + `G.overflow` logged in `finishTurn`. Score 2.

**F4 Population:** colonist records w/ skill, fatigue, morale, job, assign; `workMult(c,job)` reads `c.skill`/`c.fatigue`, used in `prodOne`. Score 2.

**F5 Needs:** `needsPhase` consumes food/water, unfed/unwat lower morale (-12/-15), morale recovers when fed/watered (+1..+3), fatigue recovers when resting. Score 2.

**F6 Research:** 10 nodes in `RDEF`; prereqs checked in `buyResearch`; cost paid via `payCost`; effects read via `G.research.x` in `prodOne`/`stormPhase`/`tradePhase`/`needsPhase`. Score 2.

**F7 Events:** 12 events in `EVENTS`; weighted pick in `eventPhase` (`e.w`); 6 events (refugees, bloom, ventsurge, wanderer, illness, seedvault) have 2-3 differentiated choices; `G.evCooldown[id]=8` set on fire, decremented each turn. Score 2.

**F8 Trade:** `unitPrice` reads `G.res[g]`/`capOf` (scarcity) and `G.drift[g]` (drift, updated in `tradePhase`); `G.caravan.inv`/`bank` limited; `doBuy`/`doSell` both functional. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard:** `stormPhase` fires on `G.nextStorm`, severity grows with `G.turn` (`1+floor(turn/15)`); `dmg>=2` disables, `dmg===1` halves output in `prodOne`; `bracing`/`domes`/`stormwall` reduce chance; `tryRepair` spends parts. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load:** `saveString` = full JSON; `loadString`/`validateState` parse and check many fields, return specific error strings; wired to Dev tab textarea. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions:** win (turn 60 + pop/food/water/morale) and lose (`colonists.length===0`) both set in `finishTurn`, both reachable; `score()` combines pop/research/stock/turns/bonus; `showEndModal` renders summary. Score 2.

**F12 UI:** `renderTabs`/`curTab` switch tabs; `log()` stores `{t:G.turn,m}` rendered as "T#"; extensive `data-tip` tooltips; Space + digit-key shortcuts; `@media(max-width:680px)` layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel:** `runTestsCore` asserts real invariants (no negative res, caps respected, prereqs enforced, save/load hash match, cooldown set, win/lose trigger); `runBenchmarkCore` is DOM-free, runs `applyPolicy`+`doTurn` loop, prints `hashState`. Score 2.

**G1:** `G.research.filtration/drilling/hydro/smelting/tooling` read directly inside `prodOne`'s per-building switch, applied every production tick. Score 4.

**G2:** `needsPhase` shortfall → `c.morale` -12/-15 → next `prodOne` call reads `workMult(c,job)` gated by `c.morale`. Score 4.

**G3:** `stormPhase` sets `b.dmg++` → `prodOne` checks `dmg>=2`/`dmgMult=0.5` → `tryRepair` spends parts, resets `dmg=0`, restoring full output. Score 4.

**G4:** `unitPrice` = `BASE_PRICE*G.drift[g]*scarcity(G.res[g]/capOf)`, `drift` updated every `tradePhase`, shown live in `renderTrade`. Score 4.

**G5:** `refugees`/`bloom`/`wanderer`/`illness` choice `apply()` fns mutate `G.colonists`, `G.res`, `G.map[i].b.dmg` — not just `log()`. Score 4.

